1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,666
Why does the medium matter?

2
00:00:01,666 --> 00:00:05,377
Think of it as a line of masses joined by springs.

3
00:00:05,377 --> 00:00:12,213
Push the first mass, and it squeezes its spring, which pushes the next mass, and so on down the line.

4
00:00:12,213 --> 00:00:14,817
The springs supply elasticity.

5
00:00:14,817 --> 00:00:16,731
The masses supply inertia.

